  "question": {
    "text": "The root mean square speed of <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math> molecules in sample at temperature T is 'x'. If the temperature is doubled, then nitrogen molecules dissociate into atoms, the root mean square speed of nitrogen atoms becomes n times of 'x' find the value of n here?",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "2",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow></mfrac></msqrt></math><br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>28</mn></mrow></mfrac></msqrt></math> …(i)<br /><math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mo>×</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>14</mn></mrow></mfrac></msqrt></math> …(ii)<br />Dividing equation (i) by equation (ii)<br /><math><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac></msqrt></math><br />So, <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></math><br />So, n = 2.",
